     "text": "Smart Mining"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 19,
     "text": "See how our smart mining approach delivers Customer Success Programs that drive more value for your operations. Whether your needs begin at the task, process or enterprise optimization level, we equip you with the technology, scalable solutions and flexible support you need to meet your business goals."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 20,
