    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 25,
     "text": "Smart Quarry"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 26,
     "text": "Let Smart Quarry consultants do the heavy mental lifting for you. With minimal impact to your day and operation, Smart Quarry will assess the needs of your job site and recommend the best fleet to help meet your current and future production goals. Using expertise in digital solutions, Smart Quarry will help connect you with the right tools to better understand, track and optimize your mobile equipment. Together, this can result in a lower unit cost for improved bottom line."
    },
